{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1138908-is-this-idea-to-silly-for-a-cod-game","id":1138908,"title":"Is this idea to silly for a Cod game?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-09T09:20:52-07:00","id":1138908,"title":"Is this idea to silly for a Cod game?","content":"I thought up a idea for CoD game where the main antagonists are a cult that dresses up as clowns. Does this idea sound to silly for Chronicles of Darkness?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T09:38:19-07:00","id":1138912,"title":"","content":"depends on the clown. Maybe they could be a cult following that face-stealing clown Horror from the corebook that masquerades as a popular entertainer-for-hire company for kids birthday parties to scope out new targets for him. I wouldn't have them always dressing as clowns on the job, as not all people like clowns anymore. Have some comedians and magicians involved, perhaps an acrobat.<br /> <br /> Also, clothes made of human body parts are scary even if they are clown-themed. remember that and use it for their secret rituals, like fake noses that are actually real noses and big, floppy human-leather shoes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T09:39:49-07:00","id":1138913,"title":"","content":"Also, jesters. Jester costumes are less outright weir and have more of a history that could be be drawn for occult symbolism, due to their reputations as lone speakers of truth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T09:45:05-07:00","id":1138916,"title":"","content":"It is a versatile system in my opinion. As long as you set the tone and expectations I dont see why you shouldn't do it. If you still worried let me put this in perspective. On april 1st 2010 They released a supplement called Dudes Of Legend to celebrate April fools. This is all about making your game exactly as absurd or ridiculous as you want it. It included merits on: being a ninja, gaining armor just because your manly (or bountiful) chest is exposed, unicorns, and even went a low brow as to include merits for exceptional genitalia. They let Eddy Webb release a supplement where one can use their penis as a weapon or vagina as a storage cache. Im not joking. Please don't sick the moderators on me. They actually did that. The chronicles of darkness system should be able to accommodate your clown cult just fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13691-margul","name":"Margul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T10:04:24-07:00","id":1138921,"title":"","content":"The Esoteric Order of the Final Laugh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T10:05:34-07:00","id":1138922,"title":"","content":"'Course Dudes of Legend played a little loose with the rules, what with it's 7-again katana, and the trench coat that can conceal up to 10 size points of items, eg 10 guns, two people or a small car.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T10:19:34-07:00","id":1138925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1138908-is-this-idea-to-silly-for-a-cod-game?p=1138922#post1138922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">'Course Dudes of Legend played a little loose with the rules, what with it's 7-again katana, and the trench coat that can conceal up to 10 size points of items, eg 10 guns, two people or a small car.</div> </div> </div> </div>A mage might be able to pull off the trench coat thing. Now I want to go figure that one out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13691-margul","name":"Margul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T10:30:53-07:00","id":1138930,"title":"","content":"Space 4 &quot;Secret Room&quot; pulls off the basic requirement. Maybe add some Matter to make it an intrinsic function of the coat or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T10:48:59-07:00","id":1138935,"title":"","content":"Seems to be the basic plot for the current season of American Horror Story: Cult. Plus one of the Insatiables in Beast is psychotic clown, who for a fun little twist is heavily involved with the clown groups trying to keep people aware that clowns are not evil, creepy, or the like and just want to make people laugh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T10:53:37-07:00","id":1138936,"title":"","content":"In the book Bad Monkey there's a faction of the good guys, sort of like the Guardians of the Veil, who dress as clowns to silence their targets. The idea being it's very scary, but also no one would believe you if you saw it.<br /> <br /> You could pull it off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T11:14:01-07:00","id":1138944,"title":"","content":"I'm still on for them searching out people with really big noses, slicing the noses off, hollowing them out, plasticizing them, painting them red and wearing them as part of a sacred garment. Silly, but terrifying, just like a good clown monster should be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T11:14:38-07:00","id":1138945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1138908-is-this-idea-to-silly-for-a-cod-game?p=1138935#post1138935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems to be the basic plot for the current season of American Horror Story: Cult. Plus one of the Insatiables in Beast is psychotic clown, who for a fun little twist is heavily involved with the clown groups trying to keep people aware that clowns are not evil, creepy, or the like and just want to make people laugh.</div> </div> </div> </div>Where can I find this wonderful Insatiable?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T11:21:06-07:00","id":1138946,"title":"","content":"The Night Horrors one for Beast. Conquering Heroes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T11:53:21-07:00","id":1138953,"title":"","content":"The big thing I think is justifying why they dress up as clowns. The Insatiable I mentioned was a clown before he awakened and thus it was just keeping up with his job and mixing in his new appetites. (Cult only has one episode, so aside from screwing with a lady who has an irrational fear of clowns I don't know about them.) I would personally prefer a better reason than &quot;clowns are scary,&quot; but that's also just because there are a number of reasons to justify it including the one nofather mentioned about people being unlikely to believe stories of a serial killer clown group without proof.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T11:57:42-07:00","id":1138956,"title":"","content":"What about a clown-based idigam?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T12:05:09-07:00","id":1138958,"title":"","content":"A Idigam cult was one of my original ideas. Perhaps it took the form of a giant Pitch-black Hyena called The Dark Cackler. It's cult could be dressing as clowns to make people laugh before killing them wearing the same costumes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T12:36:37-07:00","id":1138964,"title":"","content":"Instant horror: add the Skin-Thief merit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":